<task id="016" project="code-quality-and-assurance-r3">
  <metadata>
    <title>Re-baseline SCORECARD — consolidate all surface assessments into the honest aggregate</title>
    <phase>1 Full Assessment</phase>
    <gate>blocked until 010,011,012,013,014,015</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>STANDARD</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Consolidation of verified assessment rows into the aggregate re-baseline doc; no src/ or tests/ modification — STANDARD per task-create Step 3.5.5.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>The honest aggregate re-baseline is a program-authority judgment (supersedes the stale March "A 95/100") — Opus for cross-surface synthesis.</model-tier-reason>
